A dynamic cyberpunk cityscape at night where countless glowing data streams, holographic feeds, and neon communication channels flow chaotically through towering skyscrapers, converging toward a central floating hub structure that pulses with energy. Multiple transparent screens and windows hover at different angles throughout the scene, each displaying abstract flowing patterns representing different information sources. The streams are scattered and fragmented at the edges of the image but gradually weave together as they approach the central nexus. Rain falls through holographic projections, creating a sense of overwhelming digital noise. The color palette features electric blues, hot magentas, and toxic greens against deep shadows. A lone figure stands on a platform gazing at the convergence point, dwarfed by the massive scale of information swirling around them.
